{"id":"xiazpootuuta29jeom9ejbdeu","title":"榆林向产业链高端突围，煤城转型成效显著","originalTitle":"守好能源基本盘，榆林向产业链高端突围","summary":"榆林市前三季度经济指标显示转型成效显著，地区生产总值同比增长5.8%。陕煤榆林化学1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目二期工程稳步推进，预计全面建成后年销售收入约900亿元。榆林还布局氢能装备制造，陕西氢能储氢装备科技有限公司已成功下线Ⅳ型储氢瓶，面向全国开放共享。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15324044.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T02:26:25.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T02:38:28.735Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T02:38:28.735Z","category":"macro","tags":["政策发布"],"score":29,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"1c8a4e30-7508-41d6-af4d-9949687c8400","title":"榆林能源高端化转型成效显著"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(界面陕西)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"1c8a4e30-7508-41d6-af4d-9949687c8400","title":"榆林能源高端化转型成效显著"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f69nq3iqqoAo","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}